flowchart TB
    USER[User question] --> API[FastAPI Case API]
    API --> RT[Deterministic Trial Runtime]

    RT --> ING[Ingestion and Validation]
    ING --> MAN[Manifest + SHA-256]
    ING --> EXT[TXT / PDF / DOCX extraction]
    ING --> TRADE[Trade parser]
    ING --> QUAR[Quarantine + quality flags]

    EXT --> INDEX[Hybrid search index]
    TRADE --> INDEX
    MAN --> INDEX

    INDEX --> H[Heimdall\nCase builder + verifier]
    INDEX --> THOR[Thor\nHigh exposure]
    INDEX --> LOKI[Loki\nLimited exposure]
    INDEX --> ODIN[Odin\nJudge]

    H --> CASE[Shared Case File]
    CASE --> THOR
    CASE --> LOKI
    THOR --> CLAIMS[Claim ledger]
    LOKI --> CLAIMS
    CLAIMS --> CROSS[Cross-examination]
    CROSS --> RULINGS[Odin rulings]
    RULINGS --> ODIN
    ODIN --> SUFF[Evidence sufficiency]
    SUFF -->|insufficient| H
    ODIN --> BRIEF[Final briefing]
    ODIN --> EXP[Exposure table]

    H --> HM[Heimdall private memory]
    THOR --> TM[Thor private memory]
    LOKI --> LM[Loki private memory]
    ODIN --> OM[Odin private memory]

    RT --> TRACE[Append-only JSONL trace]
    TRACE --> UI[Dashboard + replay]
    BRIEF --> UI
    EXP --> UI
    INDEX --> SOURCE[Source and trade-row viewer]
    UI --> SOURCE
